Error [E0121]: `item` was consumed by `escaping lambda`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_escape_no_take.jet:12:10
    |
 12 |     sink(item)
    |          ^^^^
 Why: After a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Give away a copy instead (`~item`) where it moved
move site: source bytes 197..201; reuse site: source bytes 219..223; consuming callee: escaping lambda
